=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Gumbah} in {z:Bastok Mines} HP #3
** Proceed West and take the first opening to your right up the stairs. Make an immediate left then another right, cross the catwalk landing you at {p:Gumbah} house @ (J-7) for a cutscene.
* Head to {z:Korroloka Tunnel} either through {z:Zeruhn Mines} from {z:Bastok Mines} or via the {p:Survival Guide} warp to {z:Zeruhn Mines}.
* Interact with the **Stalagmite** targetable location in {z:Korroloka Tunnel} (D-9, Map 1) for a cutscene.
** This map is the first one you will arrive at when entering via the above methods.
** The **Stalagmite** is on the bottom level. There is no need to follow the upper path.
* Interact with the **Stalagmite** again to begin a fight against {m:Gloom Phantom} (WAR/DRK), {m:Magh Bihu} (RDM), and {m:Dazbog} (PLD).
** You have 15 minutes to complete this confrontation.
** Each NM has approximately 30k HP and can use its respective job(s)' {p:SP Abilities}
** The trio can coordinate skillchains and magic bursts if they focus on the same target
*** Gloom Phantom Rush > Drill Claw ({p:Fusion}) > Fire IV ({p:Magic Burst})
*** Gloom Phantom Rush > Thrashing Assault / Meeble Warble ({p:Distortion}) > Water IV ({p:Magic Burst})
** AA TT {p:Trust} is capable of sleeping the meeble and mandragora.
* Interact with the **Stalagmite** after completing the fight for another cutscene.
* Return to {p:Gumbah} for a cutscene and your reward.

